00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:47.140
Let's continue with part
two of your introduction,

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:49.390
and this is the complication part.

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:51.160
So these should be, then, the sentences

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:54.140
that directly follow the situation part.

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:57.280
And here, you're now
introducing some elements

00:05:57.280 --> 00:05:59.900
which make the whole
situation a bit more complex,

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:01.660
a bit more complicated.

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:04.210
Maybe there's an additional problem

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.870
that is part of the situation
that you are describing.

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:08.520
So something that maybe now

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:10.780
is indeed a little bit more controversial.

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:12.980
So here, maybe there are
some people in the room

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:14.440
or some people reading this

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:17.090
that would not necessarily agree,

00:06:17.090 --> 00:06:19.730
or maybe this is just a
little bit more controversial,

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:22.650
but this is then fine for the second part.

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:24.340
One thing that's important to understand

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:25.410
is that the complication

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:28.590
does not necessarily need to be a problem.

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:31.730
It can also just, indeed,
be just an additional factor

00:06:31.730 --> 00:06:33.910
that adds to the complexity,

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:35.020
an additional factor

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:37.940
that just makes the whole
situation more interesting,

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:40.970
more worthwhile of our attention.

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:43.500
Things like that can be
great complications as well.

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.070
Now, to make it a bit easier for you

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:47.780
to understand what a
strong complication is,

00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:50.420
let me talk about this book,
"The Pyramid Principle".

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:52.330
This is a book that I
already recommended to you

00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:53.950
in some of the prior videos,

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:54.900
and in the video today,

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:57.130
I'm also borrowing on a couple of concepts

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:58.600
that are explained in this book,

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:01.910
and indeed the
situation-complication-solution framework

00:07:01.910 --> 00:07:05.157
is also a framework that is
picked up in here and explained.

00:07:05.157 --> 00:07:07.030
And here there are a couple of examples

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:09.370
what great complications could be.

00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:12.630
Let me just read a couple of
them for you, to make it clear.

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:16.740
So a good complication could
be, something went wrong.

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:18.450
So you introduced the situation,

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:20.230
and now you are adding an additional point

00:07:20.230 --> 00:07:23.490
that shows how something went wrong.

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:26.670
Or another one could be,
something could go wrong.

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:27.790
So what would that be?

00:07:27.790 --> 00:07:28.800
Like, what are you describing?

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:30.010
Something could go wrong

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:32.090
in the situation that
you are currently facing.

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:35.670
Something changed, or
something could change.

00:07:35.670 --> 00:07:37.640
So maybe we all agree that currently,

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:39.770
the situation looks like this,

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:43.210
but maybe this is not how
it will look like forever,

00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:46.400
or here's what you might
expect to find in it.

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:48.470
So what exactly is in the situation,

00:07:48.470 --> 00:07:49.960
what is going on?

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:53.000
Or here's someone with a
different point of view.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:54.300
Maybe we all agree

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:56.830
that this is how the situation
currently looks like,

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:59.130
but other people hold these other views.

00:07:59.130 --> 00:08:00.950
This is how other people see it.

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:04.030
Or in this situation, we
have three alternatives.

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:06.380
So this is currently what we are facing,

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:09.010
and this is now what we could do about it.

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:09.990
So I hope you understand

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:13.630
the complication does not
necessarily need to be a problem,

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:15.500
but just something that
adds to the situation,

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:17.420
makes it a little bit more spicy,

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:19.460
more worthwhile of our attention.

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:21.810
Then the last part of the complication

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:24.090
should always be a question,

00:08:24.090 --> 00:08:26.800
a question that builds on the complication

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:29.960
and is then usually the most
logical question to ask.

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:31.530
So for instance, if, then

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:33.250
you are introducing in the complication,

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:34.570
the point that someone else

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:36.750
might have a different view on something,

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:40.010
well, then, the question
is, so what is this view?

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:42.180
Or if we have now three
potential solutions

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:43.500
to address an issue,

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:46.310
what are these solutions,
what could we do?

00:08:46.310 --> 00:08:50.400
Or if the situation is
changing, how is it changing?

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:53.780
So always asking this
logical, next question,

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:56.980
that also the reader
will ask him- or herself,

00:08:56.980 --> 00:08:59.700
because this is, of course,
what captivates the interest,

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:01.370
what these people want to know.

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:02.520
And now it starts to become

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:04.950
a little bit like an interesting book,

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:07.190
where you just want to
know how it continues,

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:08.360
how this goes on.

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:10.340
This is exactly how you want to captivate

00:09:10.340 --> 00:09:11.600
the interest of the people.

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:14.260
Now let's continue with
the solution aspect

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:15.150
of this introduction,

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:16.890
so the last aspect of it,

00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:19.470
and of course, the solution should provide

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:22.510
a nice and concise answer to the question

00:09:22.510 --> 00:09:24.820
that you posed in the
complication segment.

00:09:24.820 --> 00:09:26.380
What's here also important to understand,

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:28.350
is that similar with the complication,

00:09:28.350 --> 00:09:30.830
the solution does not
necessarily need to be

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:33.090
a solution to a specific problem,

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:34.130
just call it like that

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:36.720
just to make it a bit
more, like, actionable,

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:39.070
but it can also be understood
just as a key message,

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:41.320
a key insight that you want to share.

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:42.590
So based on the questions

00:09:42.590 --> 00:09:44.440
that we just asked ourselves earlier,

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:47.130
you provide a good and clear answer,

00:09:47.130 --> 00:09:50.540
the solution, the key message
that you want to share,

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:52.330
and which is now the starting point

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:55.280
for the top-down communication message

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:56.950
that you will have now to follow,

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:59.680
that's the starting point
to the main document

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:00.770
that you are now outlining.

00:10:00.770 --> 00:10:02.730
What's important about
the solution section,

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:04.760
also to provide a proper introduction then

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:07.620
to the main part of the document,

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:09.630
is then, in the end, to also outline

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:12.290
the main structure of the document.

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:15.450
So talk to the reader about
what they can now expect

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:17.180
if they continue reading.

00:10:17.180 --> 00:10:18.470
So how have you structured it?

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:20.900
How have you now detailed the solution

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:23.400
in the main part of your document?

00:10:23.400 --> 00:10:24.690
What's important on this, though,

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:27.600
is also discussed in many
of my slide writing videos.

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:29.780
Once again, if you're
interested more in this content,

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:32.750
I will link this slide writing
playlist of my channel above.

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:36.100
It's important that you do
not talk about the structure,

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:38.710
but rather the ideas, the contents,

00:10:38.710 --> 00:10:41.660
so avoid saying now, in
the solution in the end,

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:43.140
that now the document, for instance,

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:47.320
will also outline enablers of your idea,

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:49.290
but instead, in half a sentence,

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:53.180
write what the most important
enabler for your solution is.

00:10:53.180 --> 00:10:54.698
So to make this now easier to understand,

00:10:54.698 --> 00:10:57.280
let me just provide you
with a simple example

00:10:57.280 --> 00:11:00.970
of how such a total
introduction could look like,

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:03.470
now based on a document
that is maybe rather short,

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:05.050
and not that long,

00:11:05.050 --> 00:11:07.490
and this introduction goes as follows.

00:11:07.490 --> 00:11:09.437
Let me just read it out to you.

00:11:09.437 --> 00:11:11.670
"The profit margins of our company

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:15.700
have been steadily declining
over the last five years."

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:19.090
This is the situation as we've
already seen it also earlier.

00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:21.087
Next, this is now the complication.

00:11:21.087 --> 00:11:23.490
"In addition, new competitors

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:26.250
have entered our home market this year,

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:30.130
putting additional pressure
on our market share.

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:33.380
What can we do to address this issue?"

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:35.710
So here, now, you're
introducing an additional factor

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:37.570
that makes it even more challenging,

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:39.500
maybe it's a bit more controversial also,

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:42.980
but surely it provides, why act now.

00:11:42.980 --> 00:11:44.500
It provides an answer to the question

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:46.610
why now something needs to happen,

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:47.920
why this whole issue

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:51.020
is really worthwhile of
our attention right now.

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:52.947
And indeed, now you
could continue in saying,

00:11:52.947 --> 00:11:55.500
"This report outlines how a shift

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:58.230
from product selling to solution selling

00:11:58.230 --> 00:11:59.810
could defend our market share

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:01.840
and increase our profitability.

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:05.180
We will highlight what processes
and capabilities we need

00:12:05.180 --> 00:12:06.540
to make this happen,

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:09.270
and how the implementation
roadmap looks like."

00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:11.970
So here now, in the solution
segment of the introduction,

00:12:11.970 --> 00:12:14.440
you're first saying
what your hypothesis is

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:15.700
of how this could be addressed,

00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:18.560
namely the shift from product
selling to solution selling,

00:12:18.560 --> 00:12:20.760
and now you also provide a brief outline

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:22.750
of what is that we follow,

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:24.270
namely, what the key segments are,

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:25.940
but rather in the terms of ideas

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:27.370
in our structure elements,

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:29.230
namely, processes and capabilities

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:31.660
which you feel like are a
very important part of that,

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:33.410
but also the implementation roadmap,

00:12:33.410 --> 00:12:35.360
and how this will look
like, how this will happen.

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:38.410
So situation-complication-solution.

00:12:38.410 --> 00:12:40.410
It is just my humble experience

00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:43.240
that if you set up your
introductions in this way,

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:45.460
you will, in most cases, succeed

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:47.020
in providing quite an effective

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:49.170
and also interest-capturing introduction

00:12:49.170 --> 00:12:50.730
